                <pb facs="0901" n="781" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg781"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Eddy to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic">November 13,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Eddy reports that an imperial proclamation was issued to-day suspending the
                    operation of the new constitution in Poland until the present disorders shall
                    cease.)</p>
            </div>
